@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il-interpretation-time`
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g8-fees-nouns`
IMPORT `g8-fees-as-made`

-- g8-fees-as-amended.l4: the Fees Regulations as amended by the amending regulations of 2026 (Kovetz HaTakanot
-- 12383, p. 2062, 4 May 2026), over the text as made.
--
-- THE TEXT QUOTED HERE.  The amendments themselves are quoted from the gazette's text layer (cited src:kt12383:N,
-- direction marks replaced by spaces); the text they produce is quoted from the consolidated wiki (src:fees:N),
-- whose lines for regulation 1 (second definition), 2(a1) and 2(b) are the amended provisions.  The amending
-- regulations touch regulations 1 and 2 only; regulations 3, 4 and 5 of the text as made stand, and this module
-- reuses the rules of g8-fees-as-made.l4 for them (the reuse is the encoding of "stand").  The page image of p. 2062
-- was read for the figure 158.  The wiki's note "(adjusted to 2026)" on (a1) is the wiki editor's; the gazette
-- prints none.
--
-- THE VINTAGE IS AN INPUT.  This module answers for the text as amended only.  A service it does not price
-- (an objection to the score of a practical exam, since 4 May 2026) answers NOTHING, never the 40 of the text as made.

§ `The Fees Regulations as amended (Kovetz HaTakanot 12383, 4 May 2026)`

§§ `The amending regulations: publication and commencement (AMc)`

-- Kind C.  The amending regulations contain no commencement provision.  Interpretation Ordinance s 17: regulations
-- of legislative effect are published in Reshumot and take effect on the day of their publication if there is
-- no other provision.  No period is counted, so IL s 10 (including its (c)) has nothing to apply to.
-- src:kt12383:12 | קובץ התקנות,12383 י"ז באייר התשפ"ו 4.5.2026,
@ref Fees (Amendment) Regulations 5786-2026, the gazette issue date (src:kt12383:12)
GIVETH A DATE
`the 2026 amendment of the Fees Regulations was published on` MEANS
    YMD 2026 5 4

@ref Fees (Amendment) Regulations 5786-2026, no commencement provision; Interpretation Ordinance s 17
GIVETH A DATE
`the 2026 amendment of the Fees Regulations came into force on` MEANS
    `Ordinance s 17 — the day regulations of legislative effect come into force, published on`
        `the 2026 amendment of the Fees Regulations was published on`
        `unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING

-- Read with Interpretation Law s 21, the amendment binds from 00:01 on that day, which can be before the moment
-- the issue was published on it.  The text does not say otherwise (the open question of F13 of the
-- Interpretation notes).
@ref Fees (Amendment) Regulations 5786-2026; Interpretation Ordinance s 17; Interpretation Law s 21
GIVETH A Moment
`the 2026 amendment of the Fees Regulations begins to bind at` MEANS
    `Ordinance s 17, Law s 21 — the moment regulations of legislative effect begin to bind, published on`
        `the 2026 amendment of the Fees Regulations was published on`
        `unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING

§§ `Amending regulation 1 (AM1): regulation 1 gains the definition of "theoretical exam"`

-- src:kt12383:18 | בתקנות הסדרת העיסוק בעבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר (אגרות),.1 תיקון תקנה 1
-- src:kt12383:19 | התשפ"ה ( 32025- להלן - התקנות העיקריות), בתקנה,1 אחרי ההגדרה "בחינה
-- src:kt12383:20 | מעשית" יבוא:
-- src:kt12383:21 | ""בחינה עיונית" - בחינה להערכת הידע וההבנה העמוקה של לומד בקורס הכשרה
-- src:kt12383:22 | מקצועית של נושאי הלימוד העיוניים המופיעים בתוכנית הלימודים לעניין
-- src:kt12383:23 | התקנה ושירות למיתקני קירור ומיזוג אוויר ".
-- Paraphrase (mine): 1. In regulation 1 of the principal regulations, after the definition "practical exam"
-- there shall be inserted: "theoretical exam" means an exam to assess the knowledge and deep understanding of a
-- learner in a vocational training course of the theoretical subjects in the curriculum for the installation
-- and service of refrigeration and air-conditioning facilities.
-- The text produced is the wiki's line 19.
-- src:fees:19 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”בחינה עיונית“ – בחינה להערכת הידע וההבנה העמוקה של לומד בקורס הכשרה מקצועית של נושאי הלימוד העיוניים המופיעים בתוכנית הלימודים לעניין התקנה ושירות למיתקני קירור ומיזוג אוויר.
@ref Fees (Amendment) Regulations 5786-2026, amending regulation 1 (src:kt12383:18-23); regulation 1 as amended (src:fees:19)
GIVEN exam IS AN `Exam in a vocational training course`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`as amended, regulation 1 — the exam is a theoretical exam` exam MEANS
        exam's `assesses the knowledge and deep understanding of the learner in theoretical subjects`
    ... exam's `taken by a learner in a vocational training course`
    ... exam's `on subjects in the curriculum for the installation and service of cooling facilities`

-- The definition of "practical exam" is not touched.
-- src:fees:18 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”בחינה מעשית“ – בחינה להערכת הידע והמיומנויות המעשיות של לומד בקורס הכשרה מקצועית המופיעים בתוכנית הלימודים לעניין התקנה ושירות למיתקני קירור ומיזוג אוויר;
@ref Fees Regulations as amended, regulation 1, "practical exam" (src:fees:18)
GIVEN exam IS AN `Exam in a vocational training course`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`as amended, regulation 1 — the exam is a practical exam` exam MEANS
    `as made, regulation 1 — the exam is a practical exam` exam

§§ `Amending regulation 2 (AM2): sub-regulation (a1) is inserted and sub-regulation (b) is narrowed`

-- src:kt12383:24 | בתקנה 2 לתקנות העיקריות -.2 תיקון תקנה 2
-- src:kt12383:26 | ( )1 אחרי תקנת משנה (א) יבוא -
-- src:kt12383:27 | "(א )1 בעד בחינה עיונית, ישלם הנבחן אגרה בסכום של 158 שקלים חדשים;".
-- Paraphrase (mine): 2. In regulation 2 of the principal regulations: (1) after sub-regulation (a) there shall be
-- inserted: (a1) for a theoretical exam, the examinee shall pay a fee of NIS 158.
-- src:fees:25 | {{ח:תת|(א1)}} בעד בחינה עיונית, ישלם הנבחן אגרה בסכום של 158 שקלים חדשים {{ח:הערה|(מתואם לשנת 2026)}}.
-- The figure 158 took effect with the amendment.  Regulation 3(a) updates "the amounts in regulation 2" on each
-- 1 January; the 1 January 2026 update day came before this sub-regulation existed, so on the taken reading the
-- first update that applies to it is 1 January 2027 (a fork: FRAGMENT-G8.md, and the reading of regulation 3 that
-- starts every amount at the principal regulations' first update day).
@ref Fees (Amendment) Regulations 5786-2026, amending regulation 2(1) (src:kt12383:24-27); regulation 2(a1) as amended (src:fees:25)
GIVETH A `Fee stated in a vintage`
`as amended, regulation 2(a1) — the fee for a theoretical exam` MEANS
    `Fee stated in a vintage` WITH
        `the amount stated` IS 158
        `the provision that states it` IS "2(a1)"
        `the payer the provision names` IS JUST `the examinee under the Fees Regulations`
        `the day the stated amount took effect` IS JUST `the 2026 amendment of the Fees Regulations came into force on`
        `an objection charge rather than a fee` IS FALSE

-- src:kt12383:28 | ( )2 בתקנת משנה (ב), אחרי "הוגשה השגה על ציון הבחינה" יבוא "העיונית" ובמקום
-- src:kt12383:29 | "בתקנת משנה (א)" יבוא "בתקנת משנה (א.")1
-- Paraphrase (mine): (2) in sub-regulation (b), after "the score of the exam" there shall be inserted "theoretical",
-- and in place of "sub-regulation (a)" there shall be "sub-regulation (a1)".  So (b) now reads: where an objection
-- is lodged to the score of the THEORETICAL exam, the person who lodges it shall pay, in addition to the payment of
-- the fee as stated in sub-regulation (a1), NIS 40 for each objection.  The amendment changes the scope and the
-- cross-reference of (b); it does not restate the figure, whose day of effect stays that of the text as made.
-- src:fees:26 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} הוגשה השגה על ציון הבחינה העיונית, ישלם מגיש ההשגה, נוסף על התשלום בעד האגרה כאמור בתקנת משנה (א1), סכום של 40 שקלים חדשים {{ח:הערה|(מתואם לשנת 2025)}}, בעד כל השגה.
@ref Fees (Amendment) Regulations 5786-2026, amending regulation 2(2) (src:kt12383:28-29); regulation 2(b) as amended (src:fees:26)
GIVETH A `Fee stated in a vintage`
`as amended, regulation 2(b) — the charge for an objection to the score of the theoretical exam` MEANS
    `Fee stated in a vintage` WITH
        `the amount stated` IS 40
        `the provision that states it` IS "2(b)"
        `the payer the provision names` IS JUST `the objector under the Fees Regulations`
        `the day the stated amount took effect` IS JUST `the Fees Regulations as made came into force on`
        `an objection charge rather than a fee` IS TRUE

-- Alternative for the fork "does narrowing (b) re-date its figure": the amended sub-regulation is a new
-- provision taking effect on the day of the amendment, so that the first 1 January that updates it is 2027.
@ref Fees (Amendment) Regulations 5786-2026, amending regulation 2(2); regulation 2(b) as amended (src:fees:26)
GIVETH A `Fee stated in a vintage`
`as amended, regulation 2(b) — the charge for an objection to the score of the theoretical exam, taken as a new provision from the day of the amendment` MEANS
    `Fee stated in a vintage` WITH
        `the amount stated` IS 40
        `the provision that states it` IS "2(b)"
        `the payer the provision names` IS JUST `the objector under the Fees Regulations`
        `the day the stated amount took effect` IS JUST `the 2026 amendment of the Fees Regulations came into force on`
        `an objection charge rather than a fee` IS TRUE

-- Sub-regulations (a), (c) and (d) are not touched: the text as made stands.
-- src:fees:24 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} בעד בחינה מעשית, ישלם הנבחן אגרה בסכום של 194 שקלים חדשים {{ח:הערה|(מתואם לשנת 2025)}}.
@ref Fees Regulations as amended, regulation 2(a), unchanged (src:fees:24)
GIVETH A `Fee stated in a vintage`
`as amended, regulation 2(a) — the fee for a practical exam` MEANS
    `as made, regulation 2(a) — the fee for a practical exam`

-- src:fees:27 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} בעד קבלת רישיון או חידושו לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הסדרת העיסוק בעבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר#סעיף 5|סעיף 5 לחוק}}, ישלם מבקש הרישיון אגרה בסכום של 284 שקלים חדשים {{ח:הערה|(מתואם לשנת 2025)}}.
@ref Fees Regulations as amended, regulation 2(c), unchanged (src:fees:27)
GIVETH A `Fee stated in a vintage`
`as amended, regulation 2(c) — the fee for receiving a licence or renewing it` MEANS
    `as made, regulation 2(c) — the fee for receiving a licence or renewing it`

-- src:fees:28 | {{ח:תת|(ד)}} בעד בקשה לקבלת רישיון זמני למומחה זר או לחידושו לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הסדרת העיסוק בעבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר#סעיף 9|סעיף 9 לחוק}}, ישלם מבקש הרישיון אגרה בסכום של 398 שקלים חדשים {{ח:הערה|(מתואם לשנת 2025)}}.
@ref Fees Regulations as amended, regulation 2(d), unchanged (src:fees:28)
GIVETH A `Fee stated in a vintage`
`as amended, regulation 2(d) — the fee for an application for a foreign expert's temporary licence or its renewal` MEANS
    `as made, regulation 2(d) — the fee for an application for a foreign expert's temporary licence or its renewal`

-- What the text as amended states for each head of section 59.
@ref Fees Regulations as amended, regulation 2(a), (a1), (b), (c), (d); Law s.59
GIVEN service IS A `Service under the Fees Regulations`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Fee stated in a vintage`
`the Fees Regulations as amended state, for the service` service MEANS
    CONSIDER service
    WHEN `the service of filing an application for a licence or its renewal` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `the service of receiving a licence or its renewal`
        THEN JUST `as amended, regulation 2(c) — the fee for receiving a licence or renewing it`
    WHEN `the service of filing an application for a foreign expert's temporary licence or its renewal`
        THEN JUST `as amended, regulation 2(d) — the fee for an application for a foreign expert's temporary licence or its renewal`
    WHEN `the service of being granted a foreign expert's temporary licence` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `the service of sitting a practical exam`
        THEN JUST `as amended, regulation 2(a) — the fee for a practical exam`
    WHEN `the service of sitting a theoretical exam`
        THEN JUST `as amended, regulation 2(a1) — the fee for a theoretical exam`
    WHEN `the service of objecting to the score of a practical exam` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `the service of objecting to the score of a theoretical exam`
        THEN JUST `as amended, regulation 2(b) — the charge for an objection to the score of the theoretical exam`
    WHEN `the service of attending a continuing training course` THEN NOTHING

§§ `Regulations 3, 4 and 5 stand`

-- The amending regulations do not touch them.  The rules of g8-fees-as-made.l4 for regulation 3 (update of fees),
-- regulation 4 (payment as a condition) and regulation 5 (commencement of the principal regulations) are the rules
-- of this vintage too; g8-fees.l4 calls them under both vintages.
